#: ../data/xreader.appdata.xml.in.h:1
msgid "A Document Viewer"
msgstr "Hujjatni ko‘ruvchi"

#: ../data/xreader.appdata.xml.in.h:2
msgid ""
"<p> Xreader is a simple multi-page document viewer. It can display and print "
"PostScript (PS), Encapsulated PostScript (EPS), DJVU, DVI, XPS and Portable "
"Document Format (PDF) files, as well as comic book archive files. When "
"supported by the document, it also allows searching for text, copying text "
"to the clipboard, hypertext navigation and table-of-contents bookmarks. </p>"
msgstr ""
"<p> Xreader oddiy ko‘p sahifali hujjatlarni ko‘rish dasturidir. U PostScript "
"(PS), Encapsulated PostScript (EPS), DJVU, DVI, XPS va Portativ Document "
"Format (PDF) fayllarini, shuningdek, komikslar arxivi fayllarini ko‘rsatishi "
"va chop etishi mumkin. Hujjat tomonidan qo‘llab-quvvatlansa, u matnni "
"qidirish, matnni vaqtinchalik buferga nusxalash, gipermatnni navigatsiya "
"qilish va tarkiblar jadvali xatcho‘plarini ham beradi. </p>"

